WEBVTT

00:14:59.596 --> 00:15:01.012
Strange partners?

00:15:01.521 --> 00:15:03.451
Further than that,

00:15:03.475 --> 00:15:04.829
who's in your way?

00:15:04.853 --> 00:15:07.504
Who's stopping you
from finding that common ground,

00:15:07.528 --> 00:15:10.079
and is there room for them in that circle?

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:11.752
I think there is.

00:15:11.776 --> 00:15:14.238
I think we have to be able
to find it at this scale.

00:15:15.039 --> 00:15:17.996
And it means that we're going
to have to step into that courage

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.178
and include people,

00:15:19.202 --> 00:15:20.711
hold our vision so strong,

00:15:20.735 --> 00:15:23.115
know that justice
and freedom is so important

00:15:23.139 --> 00:15:25.599
that we're able to include more people,

00:15:25.623 --> 00:15:28.321
love the people who might
not love us back.

00:15:29.005 --> 00:15:30.290
And so I want to ask you: